  "content": {
    "rendered": "\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6d1c86\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row  top_margin_40px\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"nectar-split-heading  font_size_2vw text_direction_ltr \" data-align=\"default\" data-m-align=\"inherit\" data-text-effect=\"none\" data-animation-type=\"line-reveal-by-space\" data-animation-delay=\"0\" data-animation-offset=\"\" data-m-rm-animation=\"\" data-stagger=\"\" data-custom-font-size=\"true\" style=\"font-size: 2vw; line-height: 2.2vw;\"><i >“Rhea has the drive of an entrepreneur, the mind of a scientist and the heart of a healer. She has a focused vision and an impressive speed of execution. This is due in part to her unwavering commitment, her natural ability as a community builder and leader, and the rigour she brings to the products, ideas, and services she creates. She makes an excellent collaborator and we are just witnessing the start of her success. Big things to come.”</i></div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6d24f8\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-with-aniamtion-wrap \" data-max-width=\"100%\" data-max-width-mobile=\"default\" data-shadow=\"none\" data-animation=\"none\" >\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"hover-wrap\"> \n          <div class=\"hover-wrap-inner\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"img-with-animation skip-lazy\" data-delay=\"0\" height=\"2250\" width=\"1500\" data-animation=\"none\" src=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294.jpg 1500w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294-200x300.jpg 200w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35294-1365x2048.jpg 1365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_border_width_3 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_sep_color_vista_blue vc_custom_1745331116656 wpb_content_element\" ><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span><div class=\"vc_icon_element vc_icon_element-outer vc_do_icon vc_icon_element-align-left\"><div class=\"vc_icon_element-inner vc_icon_element-color-juicy_pink vc_icon_element-size-md vc_icon_element-style- vc_icon_element-background-color-grey\" ><span class=\"vc_icon_element-icon fa fa-heart\" ></span></div></div><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1755018130635\" style=\" max-width: 650px; display: inline-block;\">\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>Dr. Rhea Mehta is a scientist, wellness visionary, and modern medicine woman blending data and devotion to help others reclaim their health and their power.</strong></p>\n<p>She holds a <strong>PhD in Molecular Toxicology and Nutritional Biochemistry</strong> and has spent over a decade working at the intersection of science, health innovation, and holistic health. As the co-founder of <strong>Aste Wellness</strong>, a ritual-led Ayurvedic skincare brand born from her own hormone healing journey, Rhea helps women reconnect with their bodies through hormone-safe, soul-aligned products and practices.</p>\n<p>An <strong data-start=\"803\" data-end=\"834\">award-winning Mantra Artist</strong>, Rhea released her debut EP <em data-start=\"863\" data-end=\"878\">Soul Ceremony</em> in 2021 — an immersive collection of sacred sounds designed to awaken presence, peace, and connection. Her music is an extension of her healing work, weaving ancient mantras into modern soundscapes to invite stillness, emotional release, and transformation.</p>\n<p>Rhea is also the founder of <strong>Global Smoothie Day</strong>, a global movement to inspire plant-powered living; co-founder of <strong>Bowhead Health</strong>, a blockchain-enabled healthtech platform for personalized and secure health data ownership; and co-founder of <strong>Reset</strong>, a tech-free wellness camp focused on healing through play, nature, and inner work.</p>\n<p>As a featured expert with MindBodyGreen, The Spruce, and multiple health media platforms, Rhea blends Western scientific training with Eastern healing lineages – drawing from her certifications in <strong>Integrative Nutrition, Kriya Yoga (including Prenatal), and Sound Ceremony</strong>.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6d37e4\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>She has <strong>spoken on stages across the globe</strong> on topics ranging from environmental toxicity to nutritional healing and women’s wellness, and she brings a unique blend of grounded expertise and intuitive presence to every room she enters.</p>\n<p>Above all, Rhea is a mother, a daughter, and a lifelong student of the body’s innate wisdom. Her work is a remembrance: that science can be sacred, and healing begins within.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6d3f90\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"img-with-aniamtion-wrap \" data-max-width=\"100%\" data-max-width-mobile=\"default\" data-shadow=\"none\" data-animation=\"none\"  style=\"margin-top: 2%; margin-bottom: 2%; \">\n      <div class=\"inner\">\n        <div class=\"hover-wrap\"> \n          <div class=\"hover-wrap-inner\">\n            <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"img-with-animation skip-lazy\" data-delay=\"0\" height=\"2250\" width=\"1500\" data-animation=\"none\" src=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259.jpg 1500w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259-200x300.jpg 200w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259-683x1024.jpg 683w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259-768x1152.jpg 768w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259-1024x1536.jpg 1024w, https://livingrhea.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/042_Rhea_35259-1365x2048.jpg 1365w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1500px) 100vw, 1500px\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-6 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: ogg-regular;\">My Story</span></h3>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_border_width_3 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_sep_color_vista_blue vc_custom_1745934365467 wpb_content_element\" ><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span><div class=\"vc_icon_element vc_icon_element-outer vc_do_icon vc_icon_element-align-left\"><div class=\"vc_icon_element-inner vc_icon_element-color-juicy_pink vc_icon_element-size-md vc_icon_element-style- vc_icon_element-background-color-grey\" ><span class=\"vc_icon_element-icon fa fa-pagelines\" ></span></div></div><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p>I was born in a small Northern Canadian town to Indian immigrant parents &#8211; my mother from India and my father, a refugee from East Africa. As a child, I struggled with chronic digestive issues and inflammatory pain, but my family’s deep-rooted love and resilience gave me an early sense of strength.</p>\n<p>It wasn’t until my twenties, while completing my PhD in Molecular Toxicology, that I hit my breaking point. <strong>Years of high stress and disconnection from my body led to a serious health crisis</strong> &#8211; one that no textbook could solve. That wake-up call forced me to turn the scientific lens inward and begin my own healing journey.</p>\n<p><strong>My path back began with real food — specifically, daily green smoothies, superfoods, and deep detoxification.</strong> I removed as many environmental toxins as I could, from what I ate and drank to what I put on my skin and stored in my home. I began to rebuild my body and rewire my nervous system through rituals that honoured simplicity, intention, and consistency.</p>\n<p><strong>That path soon led me to my ancestral practices: Vedic chanting, breathwork, and yoga.</strong> When I lost my father to digestive cancer, my devotion to holistic health deepened. And when I became a mother, everything I’d learned was tested again.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n\n\t<div  class=\"vc_col-sm-12 wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element \" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<p><strong>These moments shaped the way I view wellness: not as perfection, but as practice. Not as a fix, but as a return. </strong></p>\n<p>Today, my work is rooted in that lived experience. <strong>I support women in navigating their own healing journeys, from hormonal imbalance to burnout recovery, through a blend of science, intuition, and ancestral wisdom.</strong> Because healing isn’t linear, but it is possible. And we don’t have to walk it alone.</p>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\t\t\t</div> \n\t\t</div>\n\t</div> \n</div></div>\n\t\t<div id=\"fws_6ae14cb6d567d\"  data-column-margin=\"default\" data-midnight=\"dark\"  class=\"wpb_row vc_row-fluid vc_row\"  style=\"padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; \"><div class=\"row-bg-wrap\" data-bg-animation=\"none\" data-bg-animation-delay=\"\" data-bg-overlay=\"false\"><div class=\"inner-wrap row-bg-layer\" ><div class=\"row-bg viewport-desktop\"  style=\"\"></div></div></div><div class=\"row_col_wrap_12 col span_12 dark left\">\n\t<div style=\"margin-top: 2%; margin-bottom: 2%; \" class=\"vc_col-sm-12 text-column wpb_column column_container vc_column_container col no-extra-padding inherit_tablet inherit_phone \"  data-padding-pos=\"all\" data-has-bg-color=\"false\" data-bg-color=\"\" data-bg-opacity=\"1\" data-animation=\"\" data-delay=\"0\" >\n\t\t<div class=\"vc_column-inner\" >\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1745933599842\" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">FEATURED PAST WORK</h3>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"vc_separator wpb_content_element vc_separator_align_center vc_sep_width_100 vc_sep_border_width_3 vc_sep_pos_align_center vc_sep_color_vista_blue vc_custom_1745331116656 wpb_content_element\" ><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_l\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span><div class=\"vc_icon_element vc_icon_element-outer vc_do_icon vc_icon_element-align-left\"><div class=\"vc_icon_element-inner vc_icon_element-color-juicy_pink vc_icon_element-size-md vc_icon_element-style- vc_icon_element-background-color-grey\" ><span class=\"vc_icon_element-icon fa fa-heart\" ></span></div></div><span class=\"vc_sep_holder vc_sep_holder_r\"><span class=\"vc_sep_line\"></span></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element  vc_custom_1755281558810\" >\n\t<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n\t\t<h3 style=\"text-align: left;\">Scientific research, articles and publications:</h3>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-70880f7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"70880f7\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-5e83a0d\" data-id=\"5e83a0d\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-20bd1f2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"20bd1f2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n<ul class=\"\">\n<li><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/106Q8XuNINoXPbrFdfaxn_I7us0lKU4PL/view?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Scientific compendium on medicinal mushrooms</a>  written for Vibe Mushrooms</li>\n<li class=\"\"><a href=\"https://tspace.library.utoronto.ca/bitstream/1807/31865/6/Mehta_Rhea_201111_PhD_thesis.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Doctoral thesis</a>  on investigating the cytoprotective mechanisms of vitamins B6 and B1 against endogenous-toxin induced oxidative stress</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mindbodygreen.com/articles/5-activities-that-will-help-you-cleanse\">5 activities that will help you cleanse</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mindbodygreen.com/articles/4-years-7-cleanses-3-lessons-a-toxicologist-explains\">4 Years. 7 Cleanses. 3 Lessons. A Toxicologist Explains</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-7b60d9b elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"7b60d9b\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-8afb64c\" data-id=\"8afb64c\" data-element_type=