  "excerpt": {
    "rendered": "“Rhea has the drive of an entrepreneur, the mind of a scientist and the heart of a healer. She has a focused vision and an impressive speed of execution. This is due in part to her unwavering commitment, her natural ability as a community builder and leader, and the rigour she brings to the products, ideas, and services she creates. She makes an excellent collaborator and we are just witnessing the start of her success. Big things to come.” Dr. Rhea Mehta is a scientist, wellness visionary, and modern medicine woman blending data and devotion to help others reclaim their health and their power. She holds a PhD in Molecular Toxicology and Nutritional Biochemistry and has spent over a decade working at the intersection of science, health innovation, and holistic health. As the co-founder of Aste Wellness, a ritual-led Ayurvedic skincare brand born from her own hormone healing journey, Rhea helps women reconnect with their bodies through hormone-safe, soul-aligned products and practices. An award-winning Mantra Artist, Rhea released her debut EP Soul Ceremony in 2021 — an immersive collection of sacred sounds designed to awaken presence, peace, and connection. Her music is an extension of her healing work, weaving ancient mantras into modern soundscapes to invite stillness, emotional release, and transformation. Rhea is also the founder of Global Smoothie Day, a global movement to inspire plant-powered living; co-founder of Bowhead Health, a blockchain-enabled healthtech platform for personalized and secure health data ownership; and co-founder of Reset, a tech-free wellness camp focused on healing through play, nature, and inner work. As a featured expert with MindBodyGreen, The Spruce, and multiple health media platforms, Rhea blends Western scientific training with Eastern healing lineages – drawing from her certifications in Integrative Nutrition, Kriya Yoga (including Prenatal), and Sound Ceremony. She has spoken on...",
